% An invoice, using the SPDL 1.1 additions: a reusable definition for the
% table rules, the graphics state stack so the heading style does not leak,
% wrapped text for the notes, and a wider first column.
20 28 MediaBox

% A horizontal rule across the page, drawn wherever the caller left the
% stroke state. Definitions expand before rendering, so /Do replays these
% commands in place.
/Def rule
0 0 0 SC
1 w
1 0 18 0 l
/EndDef

% --- Heading -----------------------------------------------------------
q
/F2 24 Tf
0.1 0.1 0.4 rg
/MoveTo 2 2
(Invoice 0042) Tj
Q

/MoveTo 2 4
(Acme Widgets Ltd) Tj
/MoveTo 2 5
(Due 30 September) Tj

% --- Table -------------------------------------------------------------
q
/F2 Tf
/MoveTo 2 7
(Item) Tj
/MoveTo 10 7
(Qty) Tj
/MoveTo 14 7
(Amount) Tj
Q

/MoveTo 1 8
/Do rule

/MoveTo 2 9
(Widget, large) Tj
/MoveTo 10 9
(12) Tj
/MoveTo 14 9
(144.00) Tj

/MoveTo 2 10
(Widget, small) Tj
/MoveTo 10 10
(30) Tj
/MoveTo 14 10
(90.00) Tj

/MoveTo 1 11
/Do rule

q
/F2 Tf
/MoveTo 2 12
(Total) Tj
/MoveTo 14 12
(234.00) Tj
Q

% The item column carries long names, so give it room.
/MoveTo 2 12
160 /ColWidth

% --- Notes -------------------------------------------------------------
/MoveTo 2 15
/F3 Tf
6 4 (Payment is due within 30 days. Late payments accrue interest at 2 percent per month.) /TextBox
/F1 Tf

% --- Sign-off ----------------------------------------------------------
/MoveTo 1 20
/Do rule
/MoveTo 2 21
(Signature) Tj
/MoveTo 2 22
/CheckBox
